    cover_note='Welcome back. In Session 11 you mapped a workflow, chose for each step a rule, an AI step, an agent or a person, and put a value on the change. Every one of those steps is somebody’s work. Today is about those people: what happens to them, and how you bring them with you. It is a practical session. We look at the evidence from banks, telecoms and public bodies, redesign one job together, and then you spend an hour on a plan for your own people.',
